{%- set ok = '✅' %}{% set warn = '⚠️' %}
{%- set st = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_plan_state') %}
{%- set req = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_requested_mode') %}
{%- set eff = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_effective_mode') %}
{%- set src = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_mode_source') %}
{%- set locked = is_state('binary_sensor.climate_optimizer_live_locked', 'on') %}
{%- set age = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_plan_age') | float(none) %}
{%- set exp = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_plan_expires_in') | float(none) %}
{%- set pid = states('sensor.climate_optimizer_plan_id') %}
### Health

ℹ️ **Shadow: the optimizer plans but never acts on the heat pump.** The plan is advisory; the heating is run by the existing controller.

{% if st in ['unavailable', 'unknown'] -%}
{{ warn }} **Optimizer:** not answering (the plan sensors are {{ st }}). The heat pump is not affected.
{%- else -%}
{{ ok if eff == 'shadow' else warn }} **Mode:** requested **{{ req }}**, effective **{{ eff }}** (set by the {{ src }}{{ ': the select below' if src == 'helper' else ', the select is not read yet' }})
{%- endif %}

{% if locked -%}
{{ warn }} **LIVE requested — locked (ADR-0008 proposed).** The optimizer stays in shadow; selecting live changes nothing on the heat pump.
{%- endif %}

{{ ok if st == 'planned' else warn }} **Plan:** {{ st }}{% if st == 'mode_off' %} (the mode is off: the optimizer serves no plan){% elif st == 'expired' %} (the last plan ran out; the optimizer replans hourly){% elif st in ['skipped', 'error'] %} ({{ state_attr('sensor.climate_optimizer_plan_state', 'reason') }}){% endif %}

{% if age is not none -%}
{{ ok if exp is not none and exp > 10 else warn }} **Plan {{ pid }}:** made {{ age | round(0) | int }} min ago, valid for {{ exp | round(0) | int if exp is not none else '?' }} more min
{%- endif %}
